@startuml
title SC-ORD-007 — The order service restarts right after the debit
participant "Order\n(saga)" as O
participant "Inventory" as I
participant "Payment" as P
participant "Payment\nprovider" as PSP

O ->> I : ReserveStock
I ->> O : StockReserved
note over O : CHARGING_PAYMENT, saved with\nthe ChargePayment to send
O ->> P : ChargePayment
P -> PSP : charge
PSP --> P : captured
P ->> O : PaymentCaptured
note over O #ECEFF1 : stops before handling it:\nthe message is not acknowledged
== the order service restarts ==
note over O : reads the saga:\nCHARGING_PAYMENT
P ->> O : PaymentCaptured (delivered again)
note over O : CONFIRMING_STOCK
O ->> I : ConfirmReservation
I ->> O : ReservationConfirmed
note over O #C8E6C9 : COMPLETED\norder CONFIRMED, charged once
@enduml
